      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "EFS provides state-of-the-art detection of sophisticated misuse, while remaining compatible with zero data retention (ZDR): neither Anthropic nor any cloud providers retain enterprises' data.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
