      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Since we announced EFS in September , we've been developing it further with over 100 of our customers—including a quarter of the Fortune 100 and many companies in industries with strict rules on data visibility (like healthcare, financial services, and law).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Leading enterprises like Bridgewater, Salesforce, and Stripe have been evaluating EFS in private beta.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We need a solution that gives us strong safeguards while allowing us to keep our data in our own account.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprise Frontier Safeguards delivers just that.”",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Anthropic’s Enterprise Frontier Safeguards will enable us to use frontier models with added protection against misuse.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“With EFS, customers can keep sensitive data in their own environments, protected with their own encryption keys, while still preserving the specialized safety mechanisms frontier capabilities require.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“Enterprise Frontier Safeguards gives us exactly what we asked for: our logs stay in a Wells-managed environment under Wells-managed keys.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/zero-data-retention-with-enterprise-frontier-safeguards",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“Where we have regulated or highly sensitive data, having Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with zero data retention will allow us to confidently accelerate our AI deployment across those highly regulated and sensitive client engagements.”",
